  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Aptos -- built by ex-Meta Diem engineers using Move, AptosBFT consensus, and Block-STM parallel execution for up to 160,000 TPS. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with high-speed finality. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
